  "prefLabel": "Mtec 206.01 Procedure for Adopting Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mtec 206.01 Procedure for Adopting Rules. The board shall seek to adopt any rule, or an amendment or repeal thereof, by filing a rulemaking proceeding in accordance with RSA 541-A.\n\nSource. #11091-A, eff 5-5-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mtec200.html"
